{
  "$comment": "EXP-1291 Threads v2: THE session card ×4 — a session inside a thread (the root's own session first, every child where its `session` card message sits, an agent channel's `thread_started` cards) is ONE card = the Work card's HEADER row (work-card.json geometry.header px, radius lg, card hairline, no shadow): the state `icon` (concept), the `name` (medium, truncates), the muted `kindWord`, trailing the muted `elapsed` (tabular figures) with a 12px spinner in front while `running`. No device, account, branch or other caption. Tapping it opens that session's raw view (today's session view). Model = pure `sessionCard(session, title, now)` (TS reference packages/domain-contract/src/session-tree.ts; mirrors desktop domain::session_tree, iOS ExpCore SessionTree.swift, Android domain/SessionTree.kt), every mirror replays `cases` and compares the WHOLE expected object. state = `ended` when status ended, else `needs_you` when needsInput, else `interrupted` when blocked.kind is an interruption (`interruptedKinds`), else `blocked` when blocked is set, else `queued` when status queued, else `background` when busy AND background (EXP-1374: the turn is over, background tasks still run on its device and hold its slot), else `working` when busy, else `waiting`. name = `title`, the session's display title (EXP-1341 session-title.json `sessionTitle`; never `Session N`). elapsed = startedAt → now (ended: → endedAt, else updatedAt), the work card's ladder ('37s', '2m 04s', '1h 03m'); null while queued or without a parsable startedAt. running = state working or background. tone = `tones[state]`. NEW-1: `blocked.kind` names why (contract codingSessionBlocked.kinds); `copy.blockedKinds[kind]` is the state word for it (an unknown kind reads `copy.states.blocked`); the server holds needsInput while blocked, so the card reads Needs you first. EXP-1374: an INTERRUPTION (contract codingSessionBlocked: device_offline, restarted) is never on a person: the server keeps needsInput false and the device continues the run by itself when back; kindWord = `copy.interruptedKinds[kind]`. The Dock card of the same state = `sessionBanner(session)` (dock.json `banner` source, one model x4: web agent-session.tsx useSessionDock, desktop steer_viewer, iOS AgentSessionModel, Android AgentSessionScreen): `interrupted` = {id 'interrupted', icon = icons.interrupted, label = copy.states.interrupted, text = `banner.interrupted[kind]`, tone muted, action null}, `background` = {id 'background', icon = icons.background, label = copy.states.background, text = banner.background, tone muted, action null}, any other state = null. It REPLACES the host's own offline 'paused' banner while shown; `bannerCases` replay it.",
